<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM Oct-Dec cargo up on year ago.</title>
<headline>KLM Oct-Dec cargo up on year ago.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>KLM Royal Dutch Airline's cargo traffic figures during the third quarter of its financial year showed a one percent rise in revenue tonne kilometres (RTK) from Oct-Dec 1995.</p>
<p>Details of the traffic figures included:</p>
<p>					    Oct-Dec  Oct-Dec  Percentage</p>
<p>						1996     1995     change</p>
<p> Traffic(in millions of RTKs)	1,033    1,018   up   1.5</p>
<p> Capacity(in millions of ATKs)     1,514    1,498   up   1.1</p>
<p> Cargo load factor			68.2     68.0   up   0.3</p>
<p> Yield(in NLG cents per RTK)	  45.5     44.2   up   2.9</p>
<p> Unit revenue(in NLG cents per ATK) 31.1     30.1   up   3.3</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
